"title_0" = "Relationship Description";
"title_1" = "What a man thinks of a woman";
"title_2" = "A Man's Feelings for a Woman";
"title_3" = "The way a woman sees a man";
"title_4" = "Female Image";
"title_5" = "A Woman's True Feelings for a Man";
"title_6" = "A woman's thoughts about a man";

"fool_financial" = "The card advises you to prepare to embark on a new adventure. In the near future, you have to experience something new and unusual in order to finally plunge into romance. Be willing to take risks, be brave and expand your horizons. This is what will help you find love, even in the most unexpected places. As usual, in a new relationship, you may be afraid of rejection, but this card indicates that fear should not hold you back. In love, you must be sure of yourself. Also, this card may indicate your relationship, which has ended or has been updated. Either these same relationships are gone and the time has come to start new ones, or the energies in the relationship are reset and they will no longer be the same as before. This card is a chance to start all over again, from scratch.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "The Magician card can promise you a meeting, communication and relationship with an incredibly charming and attractive person, whose influence cannot be resisted, he attracts partners and people like a magnet. When analyzing your relationship, the card recommends that you take logical, conscious and competent steps towards each other. Everything is in your hands, you are fully able to turn the relationship in the direction you need. If this card characterizes your partner, then it may indicate that it is he who controls your relationship and can manipulate at some point." ;
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "This card speaks of hidden, secret or uncertain relationships or feelings. If the relationship with your partner is not such, then there are some hidden moments with you or your partner. And this hidden moment may be the third factor that interferes with your relationship. For men, the high priestess may portend a meeting with an understanding and loving woman, with a real treasure.";
"empressCard_financial" = "The Empress tells you about true love, marriage, motherhood, home harmony, mature sexuality. She gives a surge of emotions, sensual pleasures, beautiful earthly love, complete trust and a sense of security. If at present everything is bad in your relationship, then the card portends new promising prospects, finding or changing a partner. If there is no relationship, then you are a very resourceful and abundant person and you will definitely meet your love.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "The emperor speaks of constancy and commitment, clarity and confidence, adherence to rules, not romanticism, but absolute reliability. The emperor does not tolerate frivolity and ambiguity. He clearly knows what he wants and what he does not want. The card can describe your partner in just such energies. If there is no relationship, then the card either indicates your qualities, or a meeting with a strong-willed, powerful and powerful man who can give stability, support and guardianship. For a woman, this is really the man she can rely on.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "If you are in a relationship, you and your partner are united by a common goal, a common belief in something, in a word, something more than just sympathy or passion. The Hierophant can indicate to you that the choice of your partner is correct and that he will develop your spiritual growth. If you are not in a relationship, the card indicates to you that the very right partner will appear in life when spiritual development reaches the appropriate level so as not to overshadow this connection. Therefore, the best option now would be to engage in personal growth and awareness of one's spiritual values.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "Lovers talk about the beginning of a new strong feeling or the preservation and strengthening of the old. The card speaks of the birth of a new romance, the establishment of new relationships, and the card does not say whether this will happen with a new or old partner. The card can also indicate simply good relations between people, reciprocity and harmony in relationships, affection and devotion, strong connection and unbridled dedication. When confirmed by other Arcana - entry into a successful marriage. This is a card not only of passion, but also of mutual obligations - here two stand in the presence of a Higher Power, therefore they are bound by mutual obligations. If your relationship in partnership is quite complicated, the card can talk about an intrapersonal conflict and finding a person on a choice between a sober mind and a soul.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "If you are a single person, then it is not advisable for you at this stage to start a relationship with the opposite sex. First of all, you need to think about your self-development and expansion of knowledge. It is very important for you to focus your attention on your goals now, so that later you can be proud of your achievements. If you already have a relationship, the card marks the smoothing of all conflicts and disputes in them. You have a rather harmonious and warm relationship, honesty and sincerity of your feelings.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "The card speaks of a passionate, sensual, emotionally charged relationship. And also that you are quite wise and thoughtful in them. If there are problems in relationships with a partner, then this card advises to be persistent enough gentle and unobtrusive, then you can improve the situation. If there is no relationship, then the card advises you to become somewhat more tolerant and it will be easy and pleasant for you to build them.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "The card indicates to you a deep, serious, harmonious relationship without excessive ardor and drama. This is the type of relationship of a married couple preparing to celebrate a silver wedding in full agreement. The only nuance is that you or your partner feels quite lonely, but this is not a reason to sound the alarm, this is an important period of rethinking your values ​​and gaining awareness of your life. If you are not in a couple, then the card indicates to you that you are a very wise and self-sufficient person, and even if you feel somewhat lonely, you do not feel an urgent need for a relationship.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "The Wheel of Fortune tells you that your personal relationships will improve. Circumstances in your life are now being played out, which you cannot control. Today is the result of yesterday's decisions. You do not need to make much effort now to correct relations - they are not in your power now. You can only influence yourself personally and your attitude to everything that happens in your life. Therefore, the events of today must be taken for granted and learn from them their lessons. The most important secret that lies in this card: the main thing is that you be true to yourself. This is what will help you get lucky.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "The card says that you are ready to marry or to maintain a stable and long relationship if your relationship is moving towards this. But most likely this is not passion, but more calculation and a reasonable approach. If your relationship is on the verge of breaking, then the card may indicate a divorce, which will be decided in your favor with a proper responsible approach on your part. If you are not in a relationship, then this position may be a conscious choice on your part due to the fact that you simply will not let a person close to you without proper values and beliefs. If you are already married and in order in a relationship, then the card indicates that the basis of your relationship is honesty and justice.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "This card may indicate to you a crisis in a relationship that arose due to the inability or unwillingness of partners to take into account the interests of each other and sacrifice something for this. Or it may hint that the quarrel in the relationship that has occurred is final, it will not work to restore relations. Or, as a recommendation to you personally - do not show up in relation to your partner, take an inactive position for the time being. If there is no relationship - unfortunately it is not yet expected, you are simply not ready for this due to the fact that you are most likely going through difficult life lessons now.";
"deathCard_financial" = "The card marks the beginning of your significant changes in love, which may be associated either with the renewal of your relationship, or with parting with a loved one and the subsequent emergence of a new relationship with another person. Do not be afraid of new relationships, but you should not rush them either. In your life, the stage of the deepest changes in your personality, which will definitely lead you to the better.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "If you are in a relationship, the card tells you about your compatibility, about the presence of peace and harmony, trust and understanding with your partner. There is a very harmonious and calm relationship between you. If you are not in a relationship, then the card marks family happiness in the future, but do not expect this quickly, let time take its course. We can also talk about a family that will experience happy events in life that will leave a positive mark on the fate of everyone, regardless of whether we are talking about the family that you created or were born into.";
"devilCard_financial" = "The devil, in principle, speaks of a strong relationship, but based mainly solely on carnal attraction with a partner, and he does not deserve this from you. This is not about sincere feelings and romance, only attraction and passion are meant. And regardless of whether you are currently in a relationship or not. If you love and appreciate your partner, he is dear to you, then probably either your partner succumbed to temptation, or you attract him only at the behest of passionate impulses.";
"towerCard_financial" = "Tower - the card is quite serious and unpleasant. It can be used to judge the destruction of even the strongest pair, time-tested. And here circumstances, much higher than you, clearly intervene. The tower is destroyed only when it was not built very well and many of your decisions and the decisions of your partner in the past could affect this. You can go through a serious crisis, and only incredible efforts on both sides will save the union, radically changing it for the better. The tower destroys marriages that have lasted for decades. The reason for its appearance may be the accumulated problems, from hushing up grievances to open betrayal or drunkenness. The tower can free you from hateful bonds. And although the breakup hurts, it will subside, everyone will get a chance for happiness.";
"starCard_financial" = "The card tells you that your union is ideal and has great prospects, in this partnership each of you will be able to fully open up and realize your needs. For you, this is healing love, filled with trust, delightful intimate life, beauty, tenderness, harmony and inspiration. The star can also talk about a creative union in which you cannot be disappointed in each other. Either you live at a distance and joint meetings are very rare, or there is still only a platonic connection between you. If you are not a member of the union, then you can count on the fact that the hour will surely come soon when your dreams of creating an ideal partnership for you will come true.";
"moonCard_financial" = "The card tells you that you are not particularly confident in your partner, the relationship may not seem long-term and promising to you. He may hide something from you and behave not quite naturally due to the presence of secrets, or you have secrets from your partner. Unexplained circumstances may appear in a relationship that affect the development of your relationship. Either you believe too much in your illusions, not wanting to see the truth, or someone is fooling you. If you don’t have a relationship, then this card is a reason to think about why, there may be rather vague circumstances that depend not on you.";
"sunCard_financial" = "The sun speaks of cloudless happiness, and if you are in a relationship, your union is very caring and cordial, and also promises you stability. Relationships will certainly end in a successful marriage, and if you are already in it, the card may mark the birth of a child. If you are not in a relationship, then the card speaks of the beginning of a new love relationship that will be promising and fruitful for you and will delight you like a child. There may be a desire to have joint children, or to establish a new joint business. If there are problems and difficult moments in your relationship, then life circumstances and the nuances of the relationship will begin to clear up and the situation will improve significantly, which will give you inspiration and happiness.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "In the theme of love, the Last Judgment can have some double meaning. On the one hand, she can talk about the upcoming renewal of feelings and the discovery of new opportunities. You can experience a feeling of incredible freedom that will give you an uplifted state. You may perceive yourself, your partner, and the relationship itself in a completely different way, reevaluating many of your values. On the other hand, the card may indicate that you have made a very important decision, after which your personal life will never return to its previous course. It can be both marriage and leaving relationships in which you do not see a future. The card can also indicate karmic relationships.";
"worldCard_financial" = "If you are in a relationship now, then they are very alive, filled with sincere feelings and warmth. Your partner is not just good and pleasant, here we are talking about a person whom you can confidently call your soulmate. You can feel joy and peace, love and confidence in the future with him. If you are in a quarrel with your partner, reconciliation awaits you. Also, the card can indicate relationships at a distance, for example, via the Internet. If there is no relationship, then your fate may await you in a new place, far from the place where you are now.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "There is sensuality in your relationship if you are a couple. You build your relationship on mutual understanding. Thanks to your partner, you will gain useful experience that will tell you how to move on to a new stage in the relationship. For example: from love to stability, from friendship to love. Even if there are problem situations in the relationship, they will quickly become solvable for you. If you are not in a relationship, life can give you a good friend, and then, who knows, relationships may randomly line up. At least you will be a little warmer and calmer.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "This card has a positive meaning in the layout of friendships and close relationships. It symbolizes the attainment of complete understanding and harmony between you and your friends. In addition, the card predicts a meeting with a person who will become your best friend. But you should be careful, because such a friend may have double standards and wear masks, or be somewhat conflicted. It can also indicate a former partner who is keen on you, or information about your relationship that is informative.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "The Page of Wands means a good start, a flash of emotions and passion, a new round of passionate feelings. It cannot be interpreted as an unequivocal success, this card is understood as a romantic attachment, effective flirting, a preliminary explanation. It is infatuation, but not love.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "There comes a favorable period in your life when you can enjoy a calm and harmonious relationship. It is especially pleasant when the reconciliation of two people occurs after family quarrels and conflicts. If the relationship of two people is just beginning to develop, then we are talking about strong feelings, when partners are simply attracted to each other, like a magnet. Also, the card can hint to you about the upcoming pregnancy.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "There is stability and sensuality in your relationship. If you have a sense of novelty in your marriage, then it passes very quickly. But in your relationship there is trust and reliability. And this, in any case, is more important for those people who dream of long-term relationships. You also have a physical attraction to each other. The card may indicate a fatal meeting, the desire to have a child. If you are single, then you can expect a change on the love front, you will meet your other half, but not as quickly as you would like.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "In your relationship, there is or will be a cooling of love, and if you are married, then one of the partners may have a desire to break off the relationship. The card may provide for a marriage based on a marriage contract or a fictitious one. The card says that you or your partner needs a personal living space. Some of you strive for independence in marriage and love relationships, and may also show your malice and neglect your loved one, showing your sharp tongue. If you are not in a relationship, then you are simply not ready for them until you are in a fairly belligerent position.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "The Knight of Wands has a strong sexual energy and promises emotionality and satisfaction from sex. The card symbolizes temperament and the choice between two lovers. If you are in a relationship, then the card tells you about a passionate desire to be near each other. If you are not in a relationship, then the card may speak of an intimate hobby for you.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "This card symbolizes a strong attraction to a person of the opposite sex. It doesn't matter if it's a new acquaintance, an old friend, or your spouse. In the latter case, you will have an emotional and spiritual rapprochement with your partner and your intimate relationship will improve. If, nevertheless, the acquaintance is new, then it is likely that these feelings will develop into something more. If there is no one next to you, then perhaps you simply simply do not notice the person who is in love with you and will definitely receive some news from him.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "The King of Pentacles in the interpretation of love speaks of constancy, sexual satisfaction, sincere love and the breadth of the soul. If there were doubts about whether to take the relationship in a more serious direction, then now is the time to get married and be responsible not only for yourself. If you are single, then this card indicates that there is a person who loves you very much.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The card says that a person does not want to take responsibility, treats his partner with disdain, experiments with his feelings, and prioritizes only his own interests. Who in your couple resonates with such energies, look at your situation. The card carries not only a negative meaning, but in some ways even a positive one. Relationships may become clearer in you, when until recently there was no clarity. Or you will be able to put an end to the relationship, but not in a mild form, than you can hurt another person by hurting his heart. Or coldness will be shown in your direction. If you are not in a relationship, the card may indicate the appearance of a former partner in your direction, not in prickly enough energies.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "The card says that you value loyalty very much. You will not cheat on your partner because you value what you have. You seem to be made for a family: you adore children, devoting a lot of time to raising them. You are characterized by warmth, generosity, nobility. You know how to love, and your feelings are sincere. The partner who is next to you will be happy next to you and surrounded by care. If you look just the same at your partner, then his attitude towards you corresponds to the above. The card speaks of strengthening marriage ties, good relations in the family. For lonely people, this card promises a new acquaintance with a person who is quite passionate, bright and powerful.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The king of the cup promises you the beginning of a period of idyll and romance in the union. Your partner may become more attentive, accommodating, caring and gentle. If you are married, deep feelings can flare up between you with renewed vigor. If you are single, soon you will meet a person who sincerely loves you and treats you with all his complacency and breadth of soul.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "You show yourself as a warm and loyal person in relationships. In marriage, you get sensual pleasures. You have security, or at least the desire for it. In partnership, you probably dream together with pleasure and successfully realize your dreams. And if not so long ago there was something wrong in the relationship, now much will change for the better. And if you are not in a relationship, then you are already fully prepared and formed for them.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "The Queen of Swords tells you about a fair union and equal relations. In your relationship, emotions are dominated by pragmatism. You are either a single person and a fairly independent person, or you are not just given marriage, some difficulties appear. You can see the coldness in feelings or the inability to love unquestioningly. For women, this card may indicate unpreparedness for motherhood, or fear of it.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "The card speaks of the objective attitude of partners, between whom there is equality and cordiality. Under the influence of the Queen of Wands, you can obey your loved one, show gentleness towards him. You freely exchange emotions and share impressions. There is or will be a noticeable revival in your relationship. Even mutual indifference and almost destroyed relationships can revive when this card appears.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "You do not strive for profit in a relationship, you do not act according to calculation. Everything happens at the behest of the soul and heart. The card can symbolize your huge sexual energy, but at the same time, longing for love, affection and tenderness. The card tells you that the power of love will help you achieve something very important in life, for which it is worth living. To do this, you will need not only to receive love, but also to give it in return. If you are looking at a certain person, then the card says that you are loved by him.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "The Ace of Pentacles in the spread of love and relationships is interpreted as strong and long-term family ties. Relationships between partners are built more on the basis of physical intimacy than spiritual intimacy. Often the lasso indicates a sudden turn for the better regarding romantic relationships. The card advises you to love yourself, your body, treat yourself with due respect, only after that try to look for a soul mate. If you look at the character of a partner, then the ace of pentacles emphasizes his weak will.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "Soon you will have the opportunity to find a common language with your spouse. This has probably not been the case for a long time, and your union was going through times of crisis, but in the near future everything will change. Avoid ambiguity in relationships, in love there is no room for understatement. If your relationship ended not so long ago, the card foreshadows the emergence of a new, strong and fruitful union. In everyday life and routine relationships, this card symbolizes the sudden height of passion, which will paint life in bright colors, blocking the whole routine. Frantic energy will appear, you will want to win your partner, to become the best for him.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "In the layout of love and relationships, the card denotes a happy occasion. The Ace of Wands predicts that your relationship will reach a different level, good events are “just around the corner”. It can also promise you: a wedding, pregnancy (for a woman), passionate carnal relationships, receiving joyful emotions. Perhaps you will have a new partner (or partner), or an existing relationship will gain strength. If loving people began to live together, the card indicates that the period of grinding to each other will be quite successful. Lovers will feel good together, they will try to spend as much time as possible together.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates your emotional state. This bliss, the feeling that nothing else exists for you except for this deep and vivid feeling, does not make sense. The Ace of Cups is also often a sign of your partner's devotion and loyalty. If you don’t have a relationship, the fall of such an Arcana speaks of the speedy emergence of new fruitful relationships in life, which will end for you as a result in a strong marriage in love and prosperity. At the same time, you don’t need to look for your fate, it will happen quite suddenly, as if she herself will knock on your door. If you look at a certain person who evokes sympathy, such an Arkan portends that you will begin a stormy romance with this object of sighing. If the card characterizes the beloved, then this is a sign of the gift of fate, which in no case can be rejected. Don't doubt it, don't test it.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "If you are married, then the card marks a revival in a relationship that has not experienced novelty for a long time. Your relationship will resemble pleasant, light flirting with a lack of drama. And even in the most difficult situations, you will be ready to deal with many problems without panic, there will be mitigation of circumstances. In your marriage, there may also be a share of calculation in the relationship. But this calculation cannot be called insulting, perhaps these are the conditions for survival. This can also be seen in the difference in the characters of you and your partner, when one person tolerates something in his partner, and the other allows him something. Relationships may also include friendship, sociability, cheerfulness with a sense of spontaneity and a certain efficiency.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "In love and relationships, the two of swords says the following: reconciliation with a partner, if you are in conflict, will happen very soon, because strong feelings have not cooled down yet and you should be together. A happy period is coming in your relationship: you can go on a journey together, start living together in a new house, think about having a baby. What yesterday seemed impossible for you, today will seem quite feasible. Your partner (or partner) will show you his best qualities. Your union promises to be strong and reliable. If today everything is fine in a couple, or there is no couple at all, the card says that you feel too lonely and lose interest in life.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "You probably have a desire to test your loved one for strength. You are fighting for a place as a leader in the family. This can relate to many issues, for example, who should be the head of the family. The card indicates that something will happen in life that will cause surprise and amazement among others. For relationships, this card is called sad, as it carries indifference, lack of love and real interest in a partner. If you are not married, then you may have relationships with the opposite sex, but there is no inspiration from these relationships. If you are looking at a specific person, then the card indicates a lack of interest in relation to you, or some kind of indecision.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "The card is favorable, it brings peace of mind and warmth. Two loving people will be able to find a common language, even after quarrels and conflicts, their relationship is harmonious and sincere. You will also find mutual understanding in the circle of close people. And if you have not yet sealed your relationship with marriage, you can count on romantic meetings. If you think that the perfect partnership does not exist, then you are wrong. With this card, people literally understand each other perfectly. In relationships, there is warmth, tenderness, romance, love. And in the house there is a favorable and cozy atmosphere. The card implies that you are made for each other if you have a couple. Usually they say about such people like this: kindred spirits. You always want to be together, because you understand that thanks to this you are happy and successful.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "The card says that the relationship is completely dependent on you. You have no reason to hope or blame fate - your own initiative, thoughtful actions can give you what you want. This card can also speak of the stability and seriousness of a relationship in which partners treat each other with genuine interest and respect. In such an alliance, both parties take care of themselves, strive to maintain attractiveness in the eyes of the partner, not to lose his interest. The results fully justify the effort. Also, the card may indicate family joint activities.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "The card considers feelings like this: it is a broken heart. If you are single at this stage of your life, you will not be able to find your soul mate yet. New acquaintances can further aggravate his depressive state. If you already have a family, you should prepare for a difficult period in a relationship. Quarrels, misunderstandings, rudeness on the part of the partner are possible (or vice versa). Frequent conflicts can lead to divorce. This process will not be easy. You probably won't be able to disperse peacefully. Claims, division of property and other negative events can greatly fray your nerves.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "A partnership in love, if you are in a relationship, is strong enough. With the person who is now next to you, you can safely think about plans for the future. A man can confidently propose to his beloved. A woman can have no doubt that her companion in fate is next to you. You can agree to a marriage proposal from a partner. In the event that you already have a family, minor disagreements that have arisen recently are not a reason for parting.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "The main meaning of this card is strong female friendship. In addition, the card is a symbol of strengthening relationships. This may be a marriage that is many years old, but feelings between you will flare up with renewed vigor, more than before, as if a second wind has opened. Your union will be filled with feelings, mutual respect and trust. Not only an emotional connection will be built between you, but also a karmic one. It is safe to assume that the loss of the Three of Cups in a relationship scenario means an early proposal of a hand and heart from a beloved man. If the marriage has already been created, then Arkan indicates the soonest desired pregnancy.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "The card can indicate to you a proven, stable relationship in which you have long learned to understand each other, remain unconditionally faithful and are support, support and reliable rear for each other. Another option, worse, is that there is a possessive component in the relationship. This is not necessarily a bad thing, but it should alert you. Ownership in love can give rise to both increased care and attention to the well-being of a partner, and such irrepressible jealousy that Othello will seem like an angel of patience.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "There is probably a crisis situation in the relationship between you. This is due to omissions, lack of trust in each other, cooling of feelings. The problems of your union are much deeper. The help of a psychologist is required. The fact that two people do not want to sort things out with each other is not always good. Mutual grievances and claims accumulate, and silence only aggravates the situation. Each of you lives your own separate life. Can such coexistence be called a union of two loving people? The Four of Swords suggests that you need to do something immediately: either talk to each other, discussing a future life together, or leave. There is nowhere to pull further, you have to make a decision.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "This card symbolizes the warmth, love, tenderness of two loving people. In terms of your relationship, now is a period of enjoyment from the time spent together, when the relationship is said to be on fire. Also, pleasant chores from communicating with friends are possible for you. It can be a trip to the sea in a noisy company. Maybe you just got married. You are probably waiting for a honeymoon with your loved one in one of the eastern countries, or you are just happy, calm and relaxed in the state you are in. In a word, it is happiness.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "The Four of Cups in a love scenario is a symbol of a person who cannot have a happy relationship. This happens in most cases due to the initial negative attitude towards the opposite sex. Maybe the card warns you that you have met, for example, a convinced bachelor who is never going to start a family and register a relationship. In any case, this is a card of selectivity and discontent, refusal of a chance given from above.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "This card speaks of distrust, suspicion, a crisis stage in your relationship. This can be either a problem of one of the partners (jealousy, dissatisfaction, some kind of suspicion), or a general decline in relationships that “didn’t work out”. Something in your relationship needs a life shake-up and revision.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "In love and relationships, this card does not bode well. There may be reproaches from you and your partner. The card promises quarrels, desires to take revenge on a partner. You will probably have to listen to a lot of unpleasant phrases addressed to you, or you have already had to. Scandals and quarrels in an alliance do not make such an alliance strong. You may feel like you are cornered in the union. In these relationships, a partner can oppress you, as if he takes all your energy, trying to subdue your feelings and will in everything. Tears, pain, despair do not allow a normal life, and there is no possibility (or desire) to break such an alliance. But the situation can be just the opposite if you are too tough and domineering, then it is difficult for your partner to be around you. You can be rude, impudent, used to being obeyed by everyone around you, including your loved one. The fact that in such a tandem your partner feels bad doesn’t really bother you, because you don’t see anyone except yourself. Therefore, look at the situation soberly and honestly, without embellishment, to determine what role you are in.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "The card in this scenario indicates disputes between lovers, in a couple. The constant struggle and desire to pull the blanket over you can lead to a compromise or a clear understanding of who is in the lead. Although there is a conflict, it is transparent, and you are honest with each other. It may also indicate that some problems cannot be solved without a dispute, or that there is passion in your couple and it does not let you get bored.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "When spreading love and relationships, this card speaks of confusion in your feelings or the feelings of your partner. In your relationship, there is a complete mess both in emotions and in sensations. The card also testifies to unresolved grievances and feelings after serious conflicts, perhaps even a divorce. In such a period of time it is very difficult to think sensibly and deliberately, and even more so, to reason competently. As a rule, such a card falls out to a person who is familiar with youthful maximalism and uncompromisingness. You are very easy to offend, hurt and disappoint.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "When divining for love and relationships, the card symbolizes happiness for you and strong love. You and your partner will be glad that your relationship is developing, enjoying each other's company, making plans for the future, and achieving goals together. Each of you gets equally what you deserve. The card speaks of a rich inner world, a large number of emotions that are associated with romantic relationships. The intimate sphere in your life is gradually getting better. You know how to please each other, liberate yourself.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "The main meaning of this card in the layout of relationships is big changes. This may be parting with your current partner, but a new acquaintance is also possible, which will radically change your life. It may also be that the relationship of a married couple, if you are married, will reach a new level. It can be a joint romantic vacation in one of the warm countries, or maybe you will have a desire to become parents.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "In the upright position, this card always indicates you success on the personal front. If you are single, you will have a fruitful romance that will bring with it new emotions, impressions, vivid feelings. In the case when you already have a relationship, the card symbolizes pleasant changes in your union, for example, an engagement, an early wedding, the birth of a desired child. If there are any omissions, disagreements between you, there is no mutual understanding, which develops a problem in the relationship, the card indicates the resolution of this issue. The card also portends a good call or just news that will bring great news, remind you of old acquaintances with whom you need to establish contact and communication.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "Information from the past may unexpectedly pop up for you, which will be a great opportunity for your happy future. A chance meeting can become very significant in your life. Either this is an old acquaintance or a former lover, but now he is able to awaken in a relationship a storm of emotions and feelings of those times that you had many years ago. It even seems that you never parted and did not live apart. The card means a karmic reunion and a huge sexual attraction for both people. All doubts will be dispelled, a couple in love will experience deep feelings. And you will be sure that the person with whom you will be next to is sent to you by fate.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "In this scenario, the card speaks of a deterioration in relations in your partnership, a violation of harmony and a loss of trust. It is important to accept a loved one as he is, you should not re-educate him. No need to criticize all his words and deeds, to condemn. It will be much better if you calmly talk about this topic. If you want to get advice from the card on whether to stay in a relationship or divorce, the Seven of Pentacles tells you that you cannot make a decision very quickly. You should think well about everything from the very beginning. If you are a single person, then the card tells you that you are now too focused on work processes and do not focus on relationships. Or, on the contrary, you are working too scrupulously to prepare for them.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "An unenviable card in relationship layouts. The Seven of Swords indicates that your union is complex and there is a lack of sincerity and deceit. We must pay tribute, outwardly such a union looks quite prosperous, but here everything is saturated with falsehood, including the ostentatious idyll. In your union, one of the partners manipulates the other, leads him around his finger, fools, betrays and cunning with him in all imaginary ways, looking at your situation, you will understand whether it is you or your partner. It is interesting that the one of you who trades in this initially does everything possible to earn complete trust and in every possible way maintains such a status. As a result, nothing and no one can shake such trust, even if someone provides the victim with obvious facts. Such revelations will not succeed. Usually this partner does not have feelings, he enjoys trust and love for his own good and exactly as much as he needs it.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "The relationship that this card describes is a desperate struggle. As a rule, this is a struggle for the relationship itself, since they are endangered. The card does not promise you a break, but just to prevent this from happening, a struggle is required. I must say that your positions are quite strong and if you tighten up a little, you can keep the situation and even get benefits in it. The card indicates to you that someone is interfering in the relationship. This is not necessarily a lover or mistress. It can be relatives, friends, ill-wishers. At the moment, it's time to protect your union and reduce outside influence to no.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "The card speaks of illusions about your existing relationships, imaginary feelings, disappointments. This is precisely the moment when simple sexual attraction, which is very fickle, is mistaken for love. Very often partners see each other completely different. They first came up with some kind of ideal image for themselves, and then fell in love with it, without thinking that the image does not correspond to the physical form. The card may indicate that you have come up with a non-existent relationship for yourself, you take a simple everyday courtesy for a manifestation of feelings. Following your dream of beautiful love, you can get carried away by a completely inappropriate object, not noticing the lack of reciprocal feelings.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "The card says that you are very passionate about building relationships, making every effort to do this, often devoting all of yourself to the relationship without a trace. You understand that you can’t go far on feelings alone, that relationships require work. It consists in convincing courtship, caring, striving to do everything right and receive the approval of a partner. And, as a rule, the more you invest in a relationship, the more you will get from them. The card does not indicate a rapidly emerging and spontaneously developing relationship. She speaks of a slow but sure development, where not passion, but respect is at the forefront. There are no violent emotions here, but a sincere relationship between partners, caring and attentiveness reigns. This is the area to which you have given a large share of yourself.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "The Eight of Swords does not bode well for you in personal relationships. In them at the moment you are confused, have reached a crisis state, there is a constant threat of conflict. You and your partner have already begun to interfere with each other, as if standing in the way. You cannot agree, you hide your feelings from each other, forcing yourself from the inside. At the same time, each of the partners hopes that he will not have to look for a way out, and that the second one, which irritates and makes life unbearable, will decide for him. And both of them think so. You and your partner are afraid to look for a way out, since the most likely is a divorce, and you are very tied to relationships. Internal barriers do not allow you to get a divorce, to leave. You hide behind obligations that are supposedly simply impossible to move - money, children, real estate. In the union, you deliberately deprived yourself of freedom because of the fear of taking a decisive step and because of the lack of visible prospects.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "The card tells you about love, which, like a lightning strike, will come suddenly, or has already come. It can also mean getting ready for the wedding when there is so much to organize that it just makes your head spin. If you are single, she promises you a meeting of new love, and this meeting can happen in the most unexpected place for you. The Eight of Wands speaks of the rapid development of relationships, vivid and strong feelings, and a hormonal surge. No one talks about the depth of feelings, but their brightness and explosive nature will make adrenaline boil in your blood. This is passion, desire for the object of love, quick and beautiful courtship. In fact, the card says that you just got stuck in a high-profile love story. If the alignment is done for one of the partners, then the card will indicate his selfless devotion and desire to formalize the relationship as soon as possible. For a union in which feelings have already begun to fade, and relationships seem ordinary, the card promises a rebirth, bringing freshness and romance, or an unexpected marriage proposal.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "In some cases, the card indicates that it is time for one of the partners to leave your relationship. At the same time, this departure will be painful, since it is caused not so much by desire as by necessity. The card speaks of the destruction of the union, but its versatility lies in the fact that the union itself is taken into account here. If the relationship between you is accompanied by negative emotions and events, then the card, in fact, does not imply drama, but only shows the natural resolution of your situation: you are forced to leave due to the impossibility of being together. Such a separation will only bring relief to both of you. In addition, the card also falls out in cases where it is simply time for you to end one relationship and start another. For a marriage union, this card means regret, disappointment. You are far from each other. You can look for common ground, but all the time you are forced to move away. Such a union can exist for an arbitrarily long time, but not bring pleasure. The card can also describe the past - that you have already parted ways and there is sadness about the lost.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates to you complete satisfaction with the union. Peace reigns here, and, as a rule, you do not find out questions of love to each other, because you already know the real price of love and mutual respect. Your relationship is quite stable, very predictable. You enjoy spending time in each other's company without spoiling your nerves and mood. If you are single, then the nine of pentacles indicates a comfortable state, self-sufficiency and a desire for independence. Everything suggests that you are satisfied with this state of affairs, and are not very eager to change it. You can enter into a relationship after a calm understanding of the unconditional benefits of this relationship. You can offer a relationship only if the partner really makes his life more interesting and better.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "The Nine of Swords shows you as a person who behaves rather hysterically, imposing his love, but at the slightest rejection of this by the partner, who begins to worry too much, wind himself up, and feel guilty. In addition, you are suspicious of your partner, jealous with or without reason, and jealousy can sometimes take the form of an obsession. This can manifest itself in tracking, checking personal correspondence, trying to provoke a confession of sins in a conversation, catching on a word. You may be prone to vindictiveness. You may even cause harm if you don't get the feelings you expect in return. You love and hate at the same time. If you look at a specific person, your partner, then these qualities characterize him. If you are alone, then it greatly depresses and worries you.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "The appearance of this card speaks of strong opposition in your love story. It can be directed both towards rivals and towards a partner. This card has a dual meaning. It can show both your desire to decisively defend your positions and maintain relationships at the same time, or to free yourself from past relationships in order to find freedom. If you are a lonely person, then the card speaks of perseverance in loneliness: you put up strict protection against encroachments on your freedom. It is likely that pain from a past relationship, a mental trauma, is pushing you to this. Relationships for you will only be possible when you completely let go of the situation and allow yourself not to see the threat from a potential partner. Now you are dominated by prudence and suspicion.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "The card says that the union in which you are is a harmonious combination of you and your partner. You are full of emotions and feelings, not passing interest in each other. In your relationship there is intoxicating sex, and sincerity, and complete mutual understanding. You enjoy each other's company. You are in full material prosperity, everyday problems do not interfere with your relationship. Your house is always open to friends and you are happy to arrange holidays. You like to live in a big way and involve your friends in it. If you look at one of the partners, then you should understand that he is an excellent lover, experienced in love, able to deliver maximum pleasure and subtly feeling his other half. However, this does not prevent him from being a narcissistic egoist and reveling in his own success.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "For the union, this card is perhaps the most favorable, it is much more positive than even a dozen cups. She points to a stable union in which you and your partner are happy, you are not so much financially stable and enjoy your high prosperity, but are closely connected by emotional ties. This card ideally describes the family, and exemplary relations between spouses, and excellent mutual understanding, peace and favorable disposition between generations. Your union is the standard of family relations. If you are a lonely person or look at a certain person, the card speaks of building such a union in the future.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "The Ten of Swords globally means death, weakness, it is this state that it predicts for your relationship. This is a complete and irrevocable break, which is accompanied by disappointment in love, spiritual emptiness, an extremely painful condition for you. Any attempts at reconciliation in your relationship are completely useless: after this card, there is no chance left. Your relationship has not just ended or is ending, here there is a need to completely, almost from scratch, build your future life. And under the new rules. The danger of this card is also that you lose the ability to feel and you die from the inside. Of course, a new relationship in this state is out of the question. You yourself are not ready for this. Sometimes you can even put a ban on new relationships for yourself. You remember well the pain you experienced and do not agree to experience it all again.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "The Ten of Wands indicates that the union is burdensome for partners. Perhaps your relationship initially arose under the pressure of some specific circumstances. You cannot break these relationships, you are forced to be together, but for you these relationships are a heavy burden, sometimes even overwhelming. This may be the union concluded due to pregnancy, when a man was forced to marry, because he was forced to do it. If you look at your partner, then the card speaks of his oppression. He is loaded with family worries, and sees no prospects for a way out of this situation.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "This is perhaps the most indicative card for love. It shows the highest degree of love and understanding between partners in any union. If you have a family, then your union is very strong, tested over the years and hardships. Or ready for such checks. If you are just in a relationship, then you are so close to each other that you are considered practically members of the family. The card shows all the most favorable that can be associated with the family: the birth of a child, marriage, engagement or marriage proposal, pleasant moments, successful joint housekeeping, prosperity in the house and the health of family members. In fact, this card represents a complete understanding of family happiness, as such. It can be said that you are in a state of honeymoon, and it does not matter that you have been together for several years. Your honeymoon can last as long as you like. You are very kind to each other, and sometimes it seems that you are able to retire even in a huge circle of people.";
